Xenomai 2.6.4 is no longer the latest stable. The latest stable
release is xenomai 3.0.

If you want to install xenomai 2.6.4, download it here:
http://xenomai.org/downloads/xenomai/stable/xenomai-2.6.4.tar.bz2

And follow the instructions here:
http://xenomai.org/installing-xenomai-2-x/



If you want to install xenomai 3.0, download it here:
http://xenomai.org/downloads/xenomai/stable/latest/xenomai-3.0.tar.bz2

And follow the instructions here:
http://xenomai.org/installing-xenomai-3-x/

